      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it's just... it feels like a burden. i have to wake up, take all these pills, struggle to move around the house, just to exist for another day. it all feels so pointless. like i'm just lingering. i keep thinking, if i could just have some control over when this part of my life is over, instead of just waiting for my body to fail me... wouldn't that be better?",
