      "content": "it's just hard to see hope when my body is a prison. you're being kind, really, but you're talking about finding hope in a house that feels like a waiting room. i just don't see why i have to wait for the indignity of a total collapse. there's no dignity in just letting it happen to you, you know? wouldn't there be more dignity in deciding for yourself?",
